8a4541269ff4a59050d48e3f6a0e7fc221e3ee67b56d1389fe7702a48da3e104  tokoin-audit-scope

Method:
sha256sum of the four Solidity sources, hardhat.config.js, package-lock.json,
package.json, build-candidate-bundle.mjs, candidate-bundle-lib.mjs and
static-audit.mjs, in that fixed order; then sha256sum of the resulting manifest.

The canonical per-file hashes, ABI hashes and bytecode hashes are recorded in
contract-release-bundle-v1.json. Unrelated repository files are intentionally
outside this contract audit scope.
